{"title":"The Captain's Share","html":"<article class=\"wp g-page\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\"><span class=\"q-alert-banner\" role=\"alert\"><svg class=\"q-alert-ico\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 3 2 21h20z\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><path d=\"M12 10v5M12 17.6v.4\" stroke=\"#1b1300\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/></svg><span><b>This quest is not fully written yet.</b> Steps, items or dialogue may be missing.</span></span>The pirates&#39; stash held more than gold. Harbormaster Orla Quayle wants the harbor&#39;s tide charts back, and the pirate captain has kept them for himself.</p><section id=\"g-about\"><h2>About</h2><div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-facts\"><thead><tr><th></th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Given by</td><td><a href=\"#/npc/harbormaster-orla-quayle\">Harbormaster Orla Quayle</a> <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"npc\" data-map-id=\"harbormaster-orla-quayle\">Show on map</button></td></tr><tr><td>Level</td><td>10</td></tr><tr><td>Length</td><td>Medium</td></tr><tr><td>Kind</td><td>Side</td></tr><tr><td>Quest points</td><td>2</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><section id=\"g-needs\"><h2>What you need</h2><ul class=\"q-needs\"><li><a href=\"#/item/plymouth-tide-charts\"><img class=\"g-ico\" src=\"data/img/b124b8221e9d8e1d97d1.svg\" alt=\"\">Plymouth Tide Charts</a> <b>×1</b></li></ul></section><section id=\"g-steps\"><h2>Steps</h2><ol class=\"q-steps\"><li value=\"1\">Talk to <a href=\"#/npc/harbormaster-orla-quayle\">Harbormaster Orla Quayle</a> <span class=\"muted\">(outdoors near Plymouth Wharf)</span> to get the quest. <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"npc\" data-map-id=\"harbormaster-orla-quayle\">Show on map</button></li><li value=\"2\">Ask James Hookman about the pirate captain <span class=\"muted\">at 159, -50</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"spot\" data-map-id=\"159|-50|Ask James Hookman about the pirate captain\">Show on map</button></li><li value=\"3\">Defeat Captain Sallow Brine <span class=\"muted\">at 274, 53</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"spot\" data-map-id=\"274|53|Defeat Captain Sallow Brine\">Show on map</button><br>Bring the tide charts to Harbormaster Orla Quayle - <a href=\"#/item/plymouth-tide-charts\"><img class=\"g-ico\" src=\"data/img/b124b8221e9d8e1d97d1.svg\" alt=\"\">Plymouth Tide Charts</a> <span class=\"muted\">at 155, -76</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"spot\" data-map-id=\"155|-76|Bring the tide charts to Harbormaster Orla Quayle\">Show on map</button></li></ol></section><section id=\"g-rewards\"><h2>Rewards</h2><div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-rewards\"><thead><tr><th>Reward</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Gold</td><td>280</td></tr><tr><td>Character XP</td><td>11,000</td></tr><tr><td>Quest points</td><td>2</td></tr><tr><td>Items</td><td><a href=\"#/item/health-potion-medium\"><img class=\"g-ico\" src=\"data/img/6003f0952eddf298b4c8.svg\" alt=\"\">Health Potion Medium</a> ×2</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section></div>\n      <aside class=\"wp-infobox g-aside\"><h3>The Captain&#39;s Share</h3><p class=\"g-aside-group\">Quests</p><p class=\"g-aside-h\">On this page</p><ol class=\"g-toc\"><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-plymouth-the-captains-share\" data-g-jump=\"g-about\">About</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-plymouth-the-captains-share\" data-g-jump=\"g-needs\">What you need</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-plymouth-the-captains-share\" data-g-jump=\"g-steps\">Steps</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-plymouth-the-captains-share\" data-g-jump=\"g-rewards\">Rewards</a></li></ol><p class=\"g-aside-h\">Related guides</p><ul class=\"g-toc\"><li><a href=\"#/guide/quests\">All quests</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/travel\">Travel &amp; quests</a></li></ul><p class=\"g-aside-h\"><a href=\"#/guides\">All guides</a></p><p class=\"g-note\">From the game’s own data, what players have recorded, and the <a href=\"https://binxonia.com/guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">official guide</a>.</p></aside></article>"}